    "created_at": "2016-10-20T15:14:51Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-20T15:14:51Z",
    "body": "It sounds like the real problem here is that you're treating all `<pre class=\"idl\">`s as valid IDL fragments, when really they're about things that relate to IDL.\n\nIt seems reasonable to add another signifier class that you could blacklist, so this becomes e.g. `<pre class=\"idl snippet\">`. But I don't think we want to change this into an actual IDL fragment.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
