    "created_at": "2016-10-20T15:16:18Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-10-20T15:16:18Z",
    "body": "Then perhaps it would be a good idea to perform the extraction in an official capacity, as part of the build process, so that you can use whatever markup you want and people can use the resulting IDL file to go from there…\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
