    "updated_at": "2016-10-25T09:29:24Z",
    "body": "Hmm… To me `extract` conveyed the opposite meaning: I'd extract the marked fragments by collecting them into a separate document. But actual usage indicates that your interpretation is more likely correct, @zcorpan. So far I haven't found anything making use of this class, but I haven't found time to toy around with the build system yet.\n",
